# CR 701.26a, 608.2c: tapping a creature that is already tapped does nothing, but the Role is still created and attached ("Tap target creature.
# Create a Cursed Role token attached to it."). Bot1 attacks with its own Ornithopter and casts Croaking Curse on it after combat: it stays
# tapped, becomes a 1/1 (CR 111.10j), and the Cursed Role is attached to it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Vantress Transmuter
Ornithopter
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vantress Transmuter.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Croaking Curse)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Cursed.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Exile = Vantress Transmuter
